247
00:14:58,375 --> 00:15:01,750
Ili me samo odbija

248
00:15:01,833 --> 00:15:04,125
Svaki put kad se nasmiješ

249
00:15:04,791 --> 00:15:07,458
I reci šta ima, o mučitelju!

