321
00:18:02,416 --> 00:18:04,125
Zašto da paničim?

322
00:18:04,541 --> 00:18:06,166
To nije kao moj Provident Fund
je u opasnosti, zar ne?

323
00:18:07,166 --> 00:18:08,166
Ne brinite, gospođo Geeta,

324
00:18:08,250 --> 00:18:09,166
